      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/oak-hill-martha-berry-museum/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Berry College’s Ford Complex and Old Mill have hosted scenes from films like Disney’s Perfect Harmony and Stranger Things.",
